  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add poblano pepper and sauté until slightly charred and softened.",
    "Squeeze lime juice over the peppers to add brightness and zestiness.",
    "In another bowl, mix together cream, evaporated milk, cumin, salt, sugar, cream cheese, and cinnamon. Stir in butter until well combined.",
    "Pour the sauce into a pot with the sautéed peppers and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed. Serve garnished with grated Parmesan (if using).",
    "Optional: serve over quinoa or rice for a complete meal."
